{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>Your woodcutters.</b> This teaches that Canaanites came to convert in the days of Moses, just as the Gibeonites came in the days of Joshua — and this is what is said of the Gibeonites (Joshua 9): ״וַיַּעֲשׂוּ גַם הֵמָּה בְּעָרְמָה״, and Moses made them woodcutters and water-drawers (see Tanhuma)."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 29, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:48:46.850351035Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}